  "title": "Inadvertent slide deployment during boarding",
  "narrative": "Dublin, morning. During boarding of ACX811 to Manchester (162 passengers, A320 AX-DUS), door 1R is opened for the catering truck while still armed and the escape slide inflates onto the apron. Nobody is hurt, but boarding stops and the aircraft cannot fly with the slide deployed. A contracted B1 engineer in Dublin is finishing another job; a replacement slide would have to come from Manchester. A passenger with reduced mobility is already seated on board. The stand is needed later in the morning.",
